license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.5.0"
abstract: >-
  RESIDUAL Open Core is the open verification and research kernel of RESIDUAL,
  an evidence-first platform for building, evaluating, and improving reliable
  AI-assisted and multi-agent software-engineering systems through explicit
  verification, evidence, receipts, bounded authority, and reproducible evaluation.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - software engineering agents
  - agent reliability
  - multi-agent systems
  - verification
  - reproducible evaluation
  - AI systems
